  31:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_dma.c **** 
  32:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_dma.c ****      -@-   In Memory-to-Memory transfer mode, Circular mode is not allowed.
  33:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_dma.c ****      *** Polling mode IO operation ***
  34:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_dma.c ****      =================================
  35:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_dma.c ****     [..]
  36:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_dma.c ****       (+) Use HAL_DMA_Start() to start DMA transfer after the configuration of Source
  37:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_dma.c ****           address and destination address and the Length of data to be transferred
  38:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_dma.c ****       (+) Use HAL_DMA_PollForTransfer() to poll for the end of current transfer, in this
  39:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_dma.c ****           case a fixed Timeout can be configured by User depending from his application.
  40:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_dma.c **** 
  41:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_dma.c ****      *** Interrupt mode IO operation ***
  42:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_dma.c ****      ===================================
  43:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_dma.c ****     [..]
  44:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_dma.c ****       (+) Configure the DMA interrupt priority using HAL_NVIC_SetPriority()
  45:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_dma.c ****       (+) Enable the DMA IRQ handler using HAL_NVIC_EnableIRQ()
  46:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_dma.c ****       (+) Use HAL_DMA_Start_IT() to start DMA transfer after the configuration of
  47:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_dma.c ****           Source address and destination address and the Length of data to be transferred.
  48:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_dma.c ****           In this case the DMA interrupt is configured
  49:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_dma.c ****       (+) Use HAL_DMA_Channel_IRQHandler() called under DMA_IRQHandler() Interrupt subroutine
  50:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_dma.c ****       (+) At the end of data transfer HAL_DMA_IRQHandler() function is executed and user can
  51:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_dma.c ****           add his own function by customization of function pointer XferCpltCallback and
  52:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_dma.c ****           XferErrorCallback (i.e a member of DMA handle structure).
  53:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_dma.c **** 
